EXPERIMENTAL INVESTIGATION OF HEAT TRANSFER AND PRESSURE DROP CHARACTERISTICS FOR VERTICAL DOWNFLOW USING TRADITIONAL AND 3D-PRINTED MINI TUBES
Jia Hang Chen,1 Yi Fan Yang,1 Lam Lam,1 Min Zeng,2 Ting Ma,2 Lap Mou Tam,1,3,* & Afshin J. Ghajar 4
1Department of Electromechanical Engineering, Faculty of Science and Technology, University of Macau, Macau SAR, China
2Key Laboratory of Thermo-Fluid Science and Engineering, MOE, Xi’an Jiaotong University, Xi’an, Shaanxi 710049, China
