4School of Mechanical and Aerospace Engineering, Oklahoma State University, Stillwater, Oklahoma, USA
* Address all correspondence to: Lap Mou Tam, Department of Electromechanical Engineering, Faculty of Science and Technology, University of Macau, Macau SAR, China; Tel.: +853 2837 1009; Fax: +853 2835 6102, E-mail: fstlmt@um.edu.mo
